<section class="narrow"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">MULAI BERSAMA INPROSPER</span><h1>Buat akun baru</h1><p>Daftar sebagai konsumen atau ajukan usaha untuk menjadi merchant.</p></div><div class="panel"><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="form-grid" data-role-form><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="register">
<label>Daftar sebagai<select name="role" id="role-select"><option value="konsumen">Konsumen</option><option value="merchant">Merchant</option></select></label><label>Nama lengkap<input name="name" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required maxlength="255"></label><label>Nomor telepon<input name="phone" maxlength="30"></label><label class="span-2">Kata sandi (minimal 8 karakter)<input type="password" name="password" minlength="8" required></label>
<div id="merchant-fields" class="span-2 hidden"><div class="section-rule"></div><h3>Informasi usaha</h3><p class="muted">Pengajuan merchant harus disetujui admin sebelum dapat berjualan.</p><div class="form-grid"><label>Nama usaha<input name="business_name"></label><label>Kategori usaha<select name="business_category"><option>Warung makan</option><option>Restoran</option><option>Roti & bakery</option><option>Katering</option><option>Minuman</option><option>Lainnya</option></select></label><label class="span-2">Alamat usaha<textarea name="business_address" rows="2"></textarea></label><label class="span-2">Dokumen izin usaha / identitas pemilik (PDF, JPG, PNG, WebP; maks. 3 MB)<input type="file" name="document" accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp"></label></div></div>
<div class="span-2"><button class="btn btn-primary">Daftar sekarang</button> <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="?page=login">Kembali ke login</a></div></form></div></section>
